OL,3,CWorld's seas hit hottest July
OL,4,Ctemperature on record, scientists say
OL,6,FLast month saw the highest average sea
OL,7,Fsurface temperature ever recorded for
OL,8,FJuly across the extra-polar oceans, or
OL,9,Fthe oceans free of seasonal sea ice,
OL,10,Faccording to the European climate
OL,11,Fagency Copernicus.
OL,13,FHeatwaves sweeping Europe this summer
OL,14,Falso toppled the average temperature
OL,15,Frecord for the June-July period set in
OL,16,F2022, the agency said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
