OL,3,CWorld's seas hit hottest July
OL,4,Ctemperature on record, scientists say
OL,6,FIn Western Europe, meanwhile, the
OL,7,Faverage temperature record for the
OL,8,FJune-July period hit 21.62C (70.92
OL,9,FF), Copernicus said.
OL,11,F"Persistent high-pressure systems
OL,12,Ftrapped heat over western Europe, the
OL,13,Fextreme temperatures also amplified
OL,14,Fwidespread drought," said Samantha
OL,15,FBurgess, strategic lead for climate at
OL,16,Fthe European Centre for Medium-Range
OL,17,FWeather Forecasts.
OL,19,F"As soils dry out, they lose their
OL,20,Fability to provide natural cooling,
OL,21,Fallowing heat to build more readily.
OL,26,@pD@[OXsD@AOU
