OL,3,CWorld's seas hit hottest July
OL,4,Ctemperature on record, scientists say
OL,6,F"This is a clear example of how
OL,7,Fclimate change is intensifying heat
OL,8,Fextremes, with heat and drought
OL,9,Fincreasingly reinforcing one another."
OL,11,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,12,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,13,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,14,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,16,FRecent years have seen an increasing
OL,17,Fnumber of marine heatwave events
OL,18,Faround the UK, according to the Met
OL,19,FOffice.
OL,26,@qD@fO]
