OL,3,CWorld's seas hit hottest July
OL,4,Ctemperature on record, scientists say
OL,6,FWarmer seas can have important
OL,7,Fconsequences for marine life and
OL,8,Fecosystems. Species that are typically
OL,9,Ffound further south can expand their
OL,10,Frange northwards when waters remain
OL,11,Funusually warm for prolonged periods.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/8
